kernel/ec-wake is GPL-2.0-only. The Linux patches are derivative works of their
respective Linux source files and retain their upstream GPL-compatible terms.
In particular the Linux kernel as a combined work is GPL-2.0-only; this project
does not offer an MIT licence for the Linux kernel or third-party contributions.
The GNU GPL version 2 is reproduced in licences/GPL-2.0.txt.

Third-party upstream sources fetched by the build retain their original licence
notices. Firmware, hardware calibration, Gentoo packages and external source
archives are not included in the source release and are not relicensed by this
file. See CREDITS.md and docs/FIRMWARE.md for individual provenance and unresolved
redistribution questions.
